emotional and mental-health effects such as fear, anxiety, traumatic stress, or depression.

Person wey FGM affect fit seek help from doctor, nurse, sexual-health clinic, maternity service, gynaecology service, mental-health professional, or specialist FGM service. Dem fit check for complications, treat physical problems, support sexual and reproductive health, and provide counselling or other specialist care.

If person get heavy bleeding, severe pain, fever, difficulty to urinate, fainting, or another serious complication, make dem seek urgent medical care.

If child or young person dey at risk of FGM, or somebody dey threaten or pressure person to undergo am, make dem contact appropriate health, safeguarding, child-protection, social-care, or emergency services quickly.

